{"sections":[{"slug":"结合代数上的模","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"结合代数上的模"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数上的模</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"结合代数上的模"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">结合代数可视为单对象</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"; <span lang=\"zh\">在这种意义上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">结合代数上的模可以推广为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴上的模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴上的模</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">结合代数给出</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子</span>"}},{"Plain":"; <span lang=\"zh\">在这种意义上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">结合代数上的模可以推广为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子上的模</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">结合代数上的模范畴可视为结合代数的范畴的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/切范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">切范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另外</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对一般的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/算畴上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">也可定义</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/OpAlgMod","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的概念</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">但这个概念对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/A∞-算畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">给出的是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">双模</span></strong>, <span lang=\"zh\">而非左模或右模</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}